{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e4faf9cbf45be5e158e4b64efa14f7d9256a779be8fdbcef25518e5ebcb8a98f", "ja": "（千早と雪歩が出演した映画の雑誌取材が終了！\n撮影は、映画の舞台にもなった場所で行われた）", "zh": "（千早和雪步出演的电影杂志采访结束了！\n拍摄是在电影取景地进行的）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "6e640ed81147ac159566ced97bdf292ebb9f2061627a24a357b35ef32eed5d81", "ja": "取材、とても楽しかったです。\n映画のこと、いろいろと思い出しました。", "zh": "这次采访非常开心。\n也想起了电影里的许多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "592e570bfcd7cfb52d84dcfa0d7d94bfff09e835a7a5a55dd6a7de4fab64b940", "ja": "うん、懐かしかったね。お天気にも恵まれて、\nいい写真が撮れたんじゃないかな？", "zh": "嗯，真让人怀念呢。天气也很好，应该拍到了不少好照片吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1003_p", "source_sha256": "83deaf504a414a1ea37773fe6882ff1d3f98593ad798ccf521abda28c0b3b818", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。ふたりの表情も良かったぞ。\n撮影で使った花は、映画にも出てくるんだよな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。你们两人的表情也很不错。\n拍摄时用的花，也会在电影里出现吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "137af478b7f8c5179a03a7ee6737ff71cfd46e886b9a52ad104dc26b2f739b04", "ja": "ええ。萩原さんが演じたマスターが、私が演じた\n等身大人形に贈る、赤いスイートピーですね。", "zh": "是的。萩原小姐饰演的主人，要送给我饰演的真人大小人偶的那枝红色香豌豆花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cef4aead6a2b872f98d757b853671adf3f679e3744fb6395f3e3a386d608e2ed", "ja": "赤いスイートピーには、『門出』とか、\n『優しい思い出』、そんな花言葉があるんですよ。", "zh": "红色香豌豆的花语是“启程”以及“温柔的回忆”之类的意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5a246537a7b3fc210aec6fa4e59aac66008e28154c22bde600584e763caf80ca", "ja": "マスターは、その花言葉に自分の思いを託して、\n人形に贈ったんじゃないかなって……。", "zh": "我觉得，主人是把自己的心意寄托在花语中，送给了那个人偶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a79e99431cd9020cb1644f4c4db001537356c458f48112e4f082b7553e662e77", "ja": "なるほど。花言葉で気持ちを伝えたってことか。\nなんだか切なくて、ロマンチックだな。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，他是通过花语传达心意的啊。\n总觉得有些伤感，又很浪漫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "d2fee083ca8931489d744bf20cb3281ed25ecb3d4d7d8c630ecc5f1cd972d670", "ja": "そうですね。その……実は私たちも、\n花を贈りたいと思って、買ってきたんです。", "zh": "是啊。那个……其实我们也想送花给您，所以买来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "221b9fbef6a5781f689f4617eb649f671ea5c2185802bd1440afd55125597cc1", "ja": "いつもお世話になってるお礼に、\n{$P$}に受け取ってもらえたらと。", "zh": "平时受了您不少关照，\n希望{$P$}能收下，以此聊表谢意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5470bbb703cc8634470f719a2c652a537a8e9b961a3dec96c81dd8f7f1d3ac69", "ja": "え、俺に？　それは嬉しいな。", "zh": "咦，给我的？那我可真高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "07c8bbf6bd9b5fbfa3bf80aa54ee5005a3523cfa5cfe76ebc9594d0b718b7e9e", "ja": "ふたり、色違いのスイートピーなんですけど、\n色が違うと、花言葉も変わるそうなんです。", "zh": "我们两个人的是不同颜色的香豌豆，\n听说颜色不同，花语也会随之改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5dfe579c7ea031e7c95bc555545131e86410ce77021e5d26b4bf9948d15208f0", "ja": "たとえば、ピンクのスイートピーだと\n『繊細』っていう花言葉になったりとか……。", "zh": "比如说，粉色的甜豌豆花，花语就是“纤细”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "6b98e1be4e43ac732c6ca241e7f574c3d72b11689552a43a81fea9bfaf4d2a38", "ja": "それで、私はこの紫のスイートピーを、\n{$P$}に。", "zh": "所以，我想把这枝紫色的香豌豆，送给{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ec5fcfdcc560937c1c7e9d01f1f6e46d11056ab5fa2683713b10b1f0e7506008", "ja": "私からは、白のスイートピーを……。\nう、受け取ってもらえますか？", "zh": "我……我想把这束白色的香豌豆花送给您……\n您、您愿意收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "49a11680f318e6135206058071cb3e5e3cb442392d15d62bbadd35e1a0a6c505", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　ふたりとも、ありがとうな。\n花言葉、ふたりは知ってるんだよな？", "zh": "啊，当然！谢谢你们两个。\n你们知道白色甜豌豆的花语吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e7de746db776d7e3b77bc25bfb8544e61c050767499a76daa34ea36538499eb3", "ja": "はい。白の花言葉は、私がいつも大事にしたいなって\n思ってる気持ちと同じなんです。", "zh": "是的。白色花朵的花语，和我一直想要珍惜的心情是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "5dd43c49a29db121b7d79b08fb04182eb90bf55da69633d9ff05e7204f9efc8d", "ja": "紫は、私がアイドルになれたからこそ見つけた\n思いと、同じ花言葉だったので。", "zh": "紫色的花语，和我正因为成为偶像才找到的那份心情一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1018_p", "source_sha256": "42711f7e90214a4bc02571faab5826a3706681ed27eb82bdf41280d3f725dca3", "ja": "はは……どんな気持ちがこめられているのか、\n花言葉も調べてみるよ。あらためて、ありがとう！", "zh": "哈哈……我也会查查花语，看看其中寄托着怎样的心意。再次谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "a02cad3e6cb51dbff5350e06db4056e739b790897c70a46bf866d39e66ebb3ac", "ja": "はい。喜んでもらえて、うれしいです。\n……口では恥ずかしくて伝えられないことでも……", "zh": "是的。你能喜欢，我很开心。\n……就算是不好意思用嘴说出来的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0334_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "3fc76090f23f6588d7132b46b4b78e9e31f10797e752526af68da576539c68ca", "ja": "花に思いを託せば、まっすぐ渡せるのね。\n……あ、いえ。なんでも。ふふっ。", "zh": "把心意寄托在花上，就能坦率地传达出去呢。\n……啊，没什么。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
